.TH "TreeSitter::Source" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "treesitter 0.1.0" "treesitter API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
TreeSitter::Source \- Where a \fB\%Query\fR reads node text for its predicates: anything that returns the text between two byte offsets.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "treesitter"\fR
.sp
\fBmodule TreeSitter::Source\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Where a \fB\%Query\fR reads node text for its predicates: anything that returns the text between two byte offsets.
Text kept in another structure (a rope, a line buffer) includes this instead of building one string.
.SH "DIRECT INCLUDING TYPES"
\fBTreeSitter::StringSource\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBabstract def text(from : Int32, to : Int32) : String\fR
The text from byte \fIfrom\fR to byte \fIto\fR (exclusive).
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/tree_sitter/source.cr
